sequenceDiagram
    participant C as Consumer (your app)
    participant P as Provider (e.g. Stripe)

    P->>C: POST /webhook (event)
    C--xP: 4xx / timeout / invalid signature
    Note over P: wait, then retry (exponential backoff)
    P->>C: retry delivery
    C--xP: still failing
    Note over P: dead-letter after max attempts
